<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97612" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατα-βαίνω</span></b> , fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βήσομαι</span>: aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έβην</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>go</i> or <i>come down with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾷ πτέρυγι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					505
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅμα τοῖς ᾠοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>GA</u>
					756a25
				</span></i>
			; of curls, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ταῖς παρειαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>go down together</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνέρχομαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				358b32
			</span></i>; esp. <i>to the sea-side</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὁμαλοὺς τόπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.39.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ λόφου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Crass.</u>
					31
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ταῖς ἡλικίαις ἐπὶ τὸν αὐτὸν
					καιρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1334b34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1335a31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>come down to one's aid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς . . Μοῖρά τε συγκατέβα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					1046
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				727
			</span></i> (anap.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			like Lat. <i>descendere in arenam</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εἰς κίνδυνον, εἰς πόλεμον</span>, etc.,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.89.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.66.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				12.30
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς παράταξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					17.98
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>come down to, agree to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς κρίσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.90.5
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b> metaph.,
				<i>let oneself down, submit to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς φόρους καὶ συνθήκας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.45.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. εἰς πᾶν</span>
			<i>agree to</i> all conditions, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.10.1
			</span></i>: generally, <i>stoop, condescend</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				26.1.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς λοιδορίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.383
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>7.</b>
			<i>come down in one's price</i> or <i>demands</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				21.26.12
			</span></i>. Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκαθίημι</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
